      "content": "those sound cool! i've heard shoreditch is pretty trendy. i was also looking at some other parts of east london and maybe some areas in south london because i heard they have more diversity and \"soul\" to them. are there any specific neighborhoods in those areas i should avoid tho? just wanna make sure i don't pick a spot that feels too intense or unsafe for a solo traveler.",
